{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の楽しみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『夜中、お風呂上がりに食べるみかん』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってしまうーヽ(∀)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜中のみかんはアカンやつとわかっているのにやってしまうーーーヽ(∀)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって美味しいんだもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、絶対に最高2個って決まりはつくってます！わくわくです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の『そんなバカな』に引き続き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NARUTOのOP曲  『月の大きさ』！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は時代劇の予告編風。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた今までの乃木坂にはない感じですごく面白いっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょいちょいツッコミどころがあったりね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は今回...じゃじゃーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒の師範！かつての名剣士役"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏設定としては、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月の宿敵であり、生駒たちを途中から裏切ってしまう悪いやつ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、ただ悪いやつではなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜井師範なりにきっと色んな想いがあったんだと思います..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しかったことは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"剣を鞘から抜く時、腕の長さが足りなくて格好良く抜けなかったことorz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、撮影の後半では高確率で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スルッと抜刀出来るようになってましたよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔の建物は全体的に小さめに造られているので、私くらいのサイズが意外とマッチしてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちびっこなのも悪くない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナタリーさんで若月との特集を組んでいただきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『2人でデート』がテーマということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定番デートスポットに若月と行ってきました〜☻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人について、色んなお話してきました！是非checkしてください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓↓↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://natalie.mu/music/pp/nogizaka46_07/page/7"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/11/26/4395961/0005.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}